<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">

<head>
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="description" content="RevaampAPA Cookie Policy — how and why we use cookies and similar technologies.">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/css/switzer.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/css/font-awesome.min.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/plugins/bootstrap-grid.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/plugins/swiper.min.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/custom.css" type="text/css" media="all">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
</head>

<body>
    <div id="smooth-wrapper" class="mil-wrapper">
        <div class="mil-preloader"><div class="mil-load"></div><p class="h2 mil-mb-30"><span class="mil-light mil-counter" data-number="100">100</span><span class="mil-light">%</span></p></div>
        <div class="mil-progress-track"><div class="mil-progress"></div></div>
        <div class="progress-wrap active-progress"></div>

        <div class="mil-top-panel">
            <div class="container">
                <a href="/" class="mil-logo"><img src="/img/logo.png" alt="RevaampAPA" width="83" height="32"></a>
                <nav class="mil-top-menu">
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/properties">Properties</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/hotels">Hotels</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/projects">Projects</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
                <div class="mil-menu-buttons">
                    <% if (typeof user !== 'undefined' && user) { %>
                        <div class="dropdown" style="position: relative;">
                            <a href="#" class="mil-btn mil-sm dropdown-toggle" data-bs-toggle="dropdown">
                                <i class="fa fa-user-circle"></i> <%= user.name %>
                            </a>
                            <ul class="dropdown-menu">
                                <li><a href="/dashboard"><i class="fa fa-tachometer"></i> Dashboard</a></li>
                                <li><a href="/logout"><i class="fa fa-sign-out-alt"></i> Logout</a></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <a href="/login" class="mil-btn mil-sm">Log in</a>
                        <a href="/register" class="mil-btn mil-sm mil-light">Get Started</a>
                    <% } %>
                    <div class="mil-menu-btn"><span></span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="smooth-content">
            <div class="mil-banner mil-banner-inner mil-dissolve">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-center">
                        <div class="col-xl-8">
                            <div class="mil-banner-text mil-text-center">
                                <h1 class="mil-mb-30">Cookie Policy</h1>
                                <p class="mil-text-m mil-soft">Last updated: June 2026</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mil-blog-list mil-p-80-80">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="row justify-content-center">
                        <div class="col-xl-9 mil-legal">
                            <p>This Cookie Policy explains how RevaampAPA uses cookies and similar technologies when you visit our Platform.</p>

                            <h3>1. What Are Cookies?</h3>
                            <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help the site function, remember your preferences, and understand how the site is used.</p>

                            <h3>2. Types of Cookies We Use</h3>
                            <p><strong>Essential cookies</strong> are necessary for the Platform to function, including keeping you signed in and maintaining your session security. <strong>Preference cookies</strong> remember your settings. <strong>Analytics cookies</strong> help us understand how visitors interact with the Platform so we can improve it.</p>

                            <h3>3. Session and Authentication</h3>
                            <p>We use a session cookie to keep you logged in securely as you move between pages. Disabling essential cookies will prevent you from signing in or using core features.</p>

                            <h3>4. Managing Cookies</h3>
                            <p>Most browsers let you control cookies through their settings, including blocking or deleting them. Note that blocking essential cookies may affect the functionality of the Platform.</p>

                            <h3>5. Third-Party Cookies</h3>
                            <p>Some features rely on third-party services (such as payment processors and analytics providers) that may set their own cookies. Their use of cookies is governed by their respective policies.</p>

                            <h3>6. Changes to This Policy</h3>
                            <p>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. Material changes will be notified through the Platform.</p>

                            <h3>7. Contact</h3>
                            <p>Questions about our use of cookies can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@revaampapa.com">info@revaampapa.com</a>. See also our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <footer class="mil-p-80-0">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="mil-footer-bottom">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-xl-6"><p class="mil-text-s mil-soft">© 2026 RevaampAPA. All rights reserved.</p></div>
                            <div class="col-xl-6"><p class="mil-text-s mil-text-right mil-sm-text-left mil-soft"><a href="/terms" class="mil-soft">Terms</a> · <a href="/privacy" class="mil-soft">Privacy</a></p></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </footer>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/js/plugins/jquery.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/swiper.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/gsap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/ScrollSmoother.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/ScrollTrigger.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/ScrollTo.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/plugins/magnific-popup.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>

    <style>
        .dropdown-menu { display: none; }
        .dropdown:hover .dropdown-menu { display: block; }
        .mil-legal h3 { margin: 30px 0 12px; }
        .mil-legal p { margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }
    </style>
</body>

</html>
